{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.fuyuko.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "站前有人盯着海报",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.fuyuko.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.fuyuko.first",
    "idolId": "fuyuko",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（唔……到处看了一圈，也没有特别合适的……今天先回去吧……嗯？）",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（那个孩子……看什么东西看得那么认真啊。）",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（侧脸就能看出来，很直的眼神……看着就会被吸引。）",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……果然，这个设计好可爱……",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个，不好意思。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "诶？……啊，是。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你在看那张海报？",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "是的……『ミラクル♡ミラージュ』的……我很喜欢。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（说起喜欢的东西时，表情一下子软下来了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "其实我是做偶像制作人的。如果愿意的话，要不要试试当偶像？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……诶？我，当偶像……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。刚才那个表情，我觉得很棒。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "那就，请多指教。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "ふゆ，会努力的。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她答应得太快了……而且刚才那一瞬，表情变了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "那个……有什么问题吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，不……没什么。今后一起加油吧！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
